Track 2: Port-Side Glitch
- Story & Context: Clara sat on a stack of discarded lead shielding, her acoustic guitar strings buzzing against the fretboard as she confessed her role in the lab’s accidental power surge to a room full of strangers. She looked at her hands, noting the faint blue radiation burns on her knuckles, realizing that her secret had become the rhythm of the entire scene. "My hands are maps of a place that burned down while we were sleeping."
