Track 3: Drift-Net Protocol
- Story & Context: Long after the facility was sealed, the locals whispered that if you pressed your ear to the ground near the old accelerator, you could still hear the machines humming the melody of the last rave. Old Man Miller claimed he saw a spectral boat navigating the currents of the underground wind, guided by the very pulses that once accelerated protons. "We are only the flotsam caught in the wake of the hum."
